      "limitations": [
        "Qualification covers the retained release150 public MCP uploaded-bundle two-variant blur-transfer dataset, exact nonvideo records and full LeRobot0.6.1 reopen. Valid data and distinct variants do not prove semantic intent, physical action alignment or multi-view synchronization. Final customer cohorts, other source paths and maximum bounds are separate gates.",
